# {{app_name}}: Figma to Flutter token and component map

Figma file: {{figma_url}}

Maintained by whoever runs the `flutter-figma-to-flutter` skill. Every token
or component discovered during an import gets a row here, so the next
import reuses it instead of duplicating it.

