## Adding a row

1. Check the token or component isn't already listed.
2. Add the token to `lib/core/theming/` (both light and dark) or write the
   widget in `lib/core/widgets/` (shared) or the feature's
   `presentation/widgets/`.
3. Add the row here in the same change.
